`pos` is a byte offset, but characters can be several bytes long (`é` is 2). When you skip a character, advance by `c.len_utf8()`, not 1, or the next slice would start in the middle of a character and panic. (Digits and the six operators are 1 byte each, so `+= 1` is fine for them.)

